**Model:** Short cantilever bending resonance of the curved boot base (standard engineering formula for end-mass system).

**Key equation:**  
f = (1 / 2π) × √(3 E I / (m L³))  
I = (b h³) / 12

**Validated designs** (see table above in this response).

