**Galinstan effect:** +5–10 % mass → minor frequency drop; major gains in durability, heat sinking, and EM coupling.

**Status:** Calculations confirm the whip base can be tuned to any frequency in the 0.4–5 kHz target range with current materials and micro-fabrication techniques.

